"配置提前期（补货所需的时间）。"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.footer_custom
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Every fabric has a history — and ours is rooted in Scotland's textile "
"heritage. We source, curate, and share vintage and classical floral fabrics "
"inspired by the mills, moorlands, and pattern books that shaped Scottish "
"design for over two centuries."
msgstr ""
"每种面料都有它的历史——而我们的故事扎根于苏格兰的纺织传统。我们搜集、甄选并分"
"享复古与古典花卉面料，其灵感来自两个多世纪以来塑造苏格兰设计的纺织厂、荒原和"
"图案样册。"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_about_us
msgid "Every fabric is vetted for age, origin, and condition."
msgstr "每种面料都经过年代、来源和品相的严格核查。"

#. module: textile_manufacturing
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:textile_manufacturing.view_page_home
